   $q$Twice Mei reaches toward a piece, stops, and folds her hands in her lap. What does this most likely show?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She has lost track of whose turn it is in the long game.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She is trying to distract Lorenzo with her hand movements.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She is holding back quick moves so she can think carefully.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She is nervous about the crowd and cannot decide anything.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overstated-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She is holding back quick moves so she can think carefully.$q$, $q$The text says "She did not hurry," and with extra time on her clock she can afford to stop herself and think. She goes on to make firm decisions, refusing the draw and moving her king, so she is not frozen by nerves.$q$, 'draft', '0ba977b6-b0ef-5ef9-9e77-8f888d269a25')
