   $q$Which inference is best supported by Mrs. Ostrowski's reaction when she finds the island in the log?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She doubts the entry and plans to check it before the contest ends.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She is upset that Ravi did not wake her when the island station called.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She sees the contact as a rare achievement and is proud of Ravi for it.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She is surprised that the club's equipment could reach so far away.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She sees the contact as a rare achievement and is proud of Ravi for it.$q$, $q$She searches for that entry, stops on it in a long silence, and marks it with a star, all signs that she treats it as special and is quietly proud. Nothing in her calm reaction suggests she minds not being woken.$q$, 'draft', 'a6a05ab9-b449-5c56-ae70-4422edf5b9f8')
